PauseTest
├── given caller is not pauser for pauseType
│   └── it should revert with Unauthorized
├── given caller is pauser for pauseType
│   ├── when pauseType is zero
│   │   ├── when _paused is false
│   │   │   ├── given pauseType is already false
│   │   │   │   └── it should set paused to false and emit event
│   │   │   └── given pauseType is currently true
│   │   │       └── it should set paused to false and emit event
│   │   └── when _paused is true
│   │       ├── given pauseType is already true
│   │       │   └── it should revert
│   │       └── given pauseType is currently false
│   │           └── it should set paused to true and emit event
│   └── when pauseType is non-zero
│       ├── when _paused is false
│       │   ├── given pauseType is already false
│       │   │   └── it should revert
│       │   └── given pauseType is currently true
│       │       └── it should set paused to false and emit event
│       └── when _paused is true
│           ├── given pauseType is already true
│           │   └── it should revert
│           └── given pauseType is currently false
│               └── it should set paused to true and emit event 